Could someone give me a little help with the following
questions:

1   Where I can get a standard for passwd and group?
2   Shadow standard would also be nice to have.
2.1 Is there a shadow standard?
2.2 If not, should somebody do one?
3   Does my program work on other systems (besides linux)?
3.1 If not what should be done with it?

Readme part of this file
------------------------
I know, my source code looks terrible. But it works at least
(so I hope). I have to do a list of some kind to act as a
way to reduce output verbosity.

If you modify or rewrite this program please let me hear.
I'd like to hear hints and tips what should be done better
or differently.

To check that you have good source code give following
command. If everything is fine you will get two identical
lines.

prompt> grep "  udbachk.c" README; md5sum udbachk.c
9949b33e085e859bd8c99994246ede71  udbachk.c

Janne's comments
----------------
Sami really wrote most of the program. I just gave some
